  "body": "If a brand-new home with a simple, comfortable layout is what you’ve been looking for, this three-bedroom home in Orewa is well worth a look. Positioned facing the reserve, it offers modern, low-maintenance living in a convenient\r\nlocation.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, creating a welcoming space for everyday life. From here, there is easy access to the outdoor area, providing a nice spot to relax or spend time with family and\r\nfriends.\r\n\r\nThere are three well-sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite and access to the outdoor area. The family bathroom serves the remaining two bedrooms, while an internal-access single garage and an\r\nadditional off-street parking space add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re purchasing your first home, looking to downsize, or finding your investment, this easy-care home is well worth considering.\r\n\r\nLocated in the growing Strathmill community, you’ll be within easy reach of motorway connections, Orewa Beach, local cafés, schools and shops. This is a great opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of Orewa’s growing new neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nHow to find Awa Uru Road:\r\nFollow West Hoe Heights until you see the Strathmill sign. Turn left onto Awa Uru Road and follow the signs.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
